					<div class="section-title left-border mb-40">
						<span class="title-tag">Retail Industry Focus</span> <!-- Updated -->
						<h2 class="title">Technology Solutions for<br> Retail & eCommerce</h2> <!-- Updated -->
					</div>
					<!-- Updated Text -->
					<p class="mb-25">
						RevelTek helps retailers meet modern customer demands. We build technology to create seamless shopping experiences across all channels, online and in store. We understand the retail landscape deeply.
					</p>
					<p>
						Our expertise includes eCommerce platforms, personalization engines, POS integration, supply chain optimization, and leveraging data for better decisions.
					</p>
					<ul class="about-list">
						<li> <i class="far fa-check"></i>{' '}Enhancing Customer Journeys</li> <!-- Simplified -->
						<li> <i class="far fa-check"></i>{' '}Driving Retail Tech Innovation</li> <!-- Simplified -->
					</ul>
